    "extract": "\n\n\nThe Aggregat series was a set of ballistic missile designs developed in 1933–1945 by a research program of Nazi Germany's Army (Heer). Its greatest success was the A4, more commonly known as the V2.",
    "extract_html": "<p>\n\n\nThe <b><i>Aggregat</i> series</b> was a set of ballistic missile designs developed in 1933–1945 by a research program of Nazi Germany's Army (<span><i>Heer</i></span>). Its greatest success was the A4, more commonly known as the V2.</p>"
